[[63,7,512,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>1. Open plastic protection (1a), undo retaining nut (1b) and place front seat belt upper link (1c) to one side.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/223003502.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[63,7,512,"<p>1. Undo the bolt (1a) and remove the trim (1b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/223003503.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[63,7,512,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Fit the trim and secure with a bolt.</p><p>Fit the upper front seat belt link and secure to the height adjuster by tightening the nut to torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/223000656.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Nut</p></td><td><p>FRONT SEAT BELT</p></td><td><p>M7/16&quot;</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>4</p></td></tr></table></div><p>Close the front seat belt upper link nut plastic protection.</p>"]]